# SpecialPowersChild.pushPrefEnv completion and the WebGL binding gap

Firefox repository `git:314d8065c5ad68c7e5c5f92d`, revision `1a097ed8d31f6b307a5d0ebc34a82ceaf7f3727b`. Scope: DOM Canvas WebGL conformance tests and the shared Mochitest harness. Languages in the cited files: JavaScript, HTML. File roles are listed in the metadata. No production WebGL implementation is claimed.

SpecialPowersChild.pushPrefEnv awaits sendQuery("PushPrefEnv", inPrefs), then awaits the optional callback, then awaits an early refresh when the reply requires it. It has no explicit return value, so normal promise completion resolves to undefined.

## Observed body and unresolved binding

The class method body is observed directly. The corresponding method call in `mochi-single` is observed directly. The injected `SpecialPowers` object was not traced back to this class in this pass. The proposed caller-to-method connection remains a binding gap, not a resolved call edge.

**Async completion:** runTest returns undefined after assigning src. The preference promise therefore does not await conformance-test completion. mochi-single ignores that promise. Exceptions/rejections propagate through it.

**Unresolved connection:** The injected SpecialPowers wrapper binding and parent PushPrefEnv message receiver were not followed in this bounded pass; do not describe preference restoration or parent-side mutation as fully closed.

## Evidence

[`testing/specialpowers/content/SpecialPowersChild.sys.mjs` — `SpecialPowersChild.pushPrefEnv`, lines 838–846](https://github.com/mozilla-firefox/firefox/blob/1a097ed8d31f6b307a5d0ebc34a82ceaf7f3727b/testing/specialpowers/content/SpecialPowersChild.sys.mjs#L838-L846). Exact excerpt from lines 838–846:

```javascript
  async pushPrefEnv(inPrefs, callback = null) {
    let { requiresRefresh } = await this.sendQuery("PushPrefEnv", inPrefs);
    if (callback) {
      await callback();
    }
    if (requiresRefresh) {
      await this._promiseEarlyRefresh();
    }
  }
```

[`dom/canvas/test/webgl-conf/mochi-single.html` — `SpecialPowers.pushPrefEnv`, lines 70–73](https://github.com/mozilla-firefox/firefox/blob/1a097ed8d31f6b307a5d0ebc34a82ceaf7f3727b/dom/canvas/test/webgl-conf/mochi-single.html#L70-L73). Exact excerpt from lines 70–73:

```html
SpecialPowers.pushPrefEnv({"set": [
  ['webgl.force-enabled', true],
  ['webgl.enable-draft-extensions', true],
]}, runTest);
```

