**Execution-only:** The [always-fail sentinel](3a5b3b5d-3324-4080-9187-3196bf4a7aed.md) and [inactive-attribute target](09ff632c-c5e0-445c-a5de-440fb21349eb.md) are wired through this wrapper family. No direct assertion of this specific generator or preference contract was established. Other possible test links remain unverified.

The cited implementation, callers, and applicable receiver bodies were read. An independent source review accepted this scoped relationship with its listed gaps. No Firefox or Thunderbird product tests, generator run, or build ran for this evidence. There is no runtime pass/fail result. No Thunderbird–Firefox call chain is added by this Firefox-only slice.

